---
/**
 * Ergonomia48dpSection.astro
 * Canonical Touch Target Ergonomics & 48dp/56dp Bounding Box Rules
 * WCAG 2.2 AA (Criterion 2.5.8 Target Size Minimum) & Cold-Chain Gloves Operation
 */
---

<div class="ergonomia-48dp-container" data-platform-target="universal">
  <!-- Section 1: Regla de Oro 48dp vs 56dp Industrial -->
  <section class="cuadro-card">
    <div class="cuadro-header">
      <div class="cuadro-header-left">
        <span class="cuadro-num-badge">01</span>
        <div>
          <p class="cuadro-kicker">ERGONOMÍA TÁCTIL · WCAG 2.2 AA & OPERACIONES EN FRÍO</p>
          <h3 class="cuadro-title">Objetivos Táctiles: Mínimo 48×48dp Estándar y 56dp Industrial con Guantes</h3>
          <p class="cuadro-subtitle">
            En entornos industriales de logística y cámaras frigoríficas (-20°C a 4°C), los operarios utilizan guantes térmicos gruesos de nitrilo o cuero. Nexa Mobile implementa una regla dual de accesibilidad táctil: <strong>48×48dp como piso absoluto para controles estándar</strong> y <strong>56dp de altura para botones de acción crítica en campo</strong> para eliminar falsos toques bajo vibración vehicular.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cuadro-tags">
        <span class="cuadro-tag primary"><i class="pi pi-hand"></i> 48dp WCAG 2.2</span>
        <span class="cuadro-tag warning"><i class="pi pi-truck"></i> 56dp Cold-Chain Gloves</span>
        <span class="cuadro-tag success"><i class="pi pi-check"></i> Zero Accidental Touch</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CUADRO ARQUITECTÓNICO: Matriz de Contratos Táctiles por Perfil Operativo -->
    <div class="contract-table-wrapper">
      <table class="contract-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Perfil Operativo</th>
            <th>Entorno de Trabajo</th>
            <th>Objetivo Visual</th>
            <th>Bounding Box Táctil</th>
            <th>Haptic Feedback</th>
            <th>Componentes Afectados</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Chofer en Ruta (Diego Morales)</strong></td>
            <td>Cabina de camión en movimiento, vibración en autopista, sol directo</td>
            <td>Ancho completo &times; 56dp</td>
            <td><strong class="mono-chip">56dp Mínimo</strong></td>
            <td>Heavy confirm (HapticFeedbackType.LongPress)</td>
            <td>"Registrar Arribo a Muelle", "Confirmar Despacho en Sitio"</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Bodeguero Frigorífico (Alejandro Ríos)</strong></td>
            <td>Cámara de congelados (-20°C), guantes térmicos criogénicos</td>
            <td>Fila de picking &times; 56dp</td>
            <td><strong class="mono-chip">56dp Mínimo</strong></td>
            <td>Beep sonoro + Heavy tick</td>
            <td>Botón de escaneo con CameraX, confirmación de lote FEFO</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Inspector de Maquinaria (Carlos V.)</strong></td>
            <td>Patio de tolvas, grasa, guantes de trabajo mecánico</td>
            <td>Píldoras tri-estado 56dp</td>
            <td><strong class="mono-chip">56 &times; 80dp Mín</strong></td>
            <td>Virtual click</td>
            <td>Checklist MT-042 (OK / OBSERVADO / CRÍTICO)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Comprador B2B (Buyer Mobile)</strong></td>
            <td>Oficina / Teléfono personal, uso con una mano</td>
            <td>Botón estándar 48dp</td>
            <td><strong class="mono-chip">48 &times; 48dp Mín</strong></td>
            <td>Light tick</td>
            <td>Navegación general, carritos de compra, filtros y tabs</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <!-- Visual Target Comparison Grid -->
    <div class="target-comparison-grid">
      <div class="target-spec-card">
        <div class="target-visual-box">
          <div class="target-bounding-box std-48">
            <span class="bounding-label">48×48dp Standard Bounding Box</span>
            <button type="button" class="spec-btn-demo min-48">
              <i class="pi pi-check"></i>
              <span>Botón Estándar (48dp)</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="target-spec-meta">
          <strong>Uso Estándar (WCAG 2.2 AA)</strong>
          <p>Mínimo accesible para navegación, checkboxes, radios y chips con una mano en condiciones normales.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="target-spec-card">
        <div class="target-visual-box">
          <div class="target-bounding-box ind-56">
            <span class="bounding-label industrial">56×56dp Industrial Box (Cold-Chain Gloves)</span>
            <button type="button" class="spec-btn-demo max-56">
              <i class="pi pi-truck"></i>
              <span>Confirmar Entrega en Sitio (56dp)</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="target-spec-meta">
          <strong>Uso Industrial (ADR-0018 Field Safety)</strong>
          <p>Superficie extendida con borde visual contrastado para evitar pulsaciones erróneas con guantes térmicos.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 2: Contrato de Código Kotlin Compose Touch Targets -->
  <section class="cuadro-card">
    <div class="cuadro-header">
      <div class="cuadro-header-left">
        <span class="cuadro-num-badge">02</span>
        <div>
          <p class="cuadro-kicker">CÓDIGO DE PRODUCCIÓN · KOTLIN JETPACK COMPOSE</p>
          <h3 class="cuadro-title">Garantía de Touch Targets en Compose</h3>
          <p class="cuadro-subtitle">
            Implementación nativa utilizando <code>Modifier.minimumInteractiveComponentSize()</code> y extensiones de 56dp.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="code-container-block">
      <div class="code-header-bar">
        <div class="code-header-title">
          <i class="pi pi-file"></i>
          <span>core/designsystem/src/main/kotlin/com/nexa/core/designsystem/component/Button.kt</span>
        </div>
        <span class="code-lang-pill">Kotlin 2.4</span>
      </div>
      <pre class="code-pre-box" is:raw><code><span class="comm">// Canonical Touch Target Implementation for Standard (48dp) and Industrial (56dp)</span>
<span class="kw">package</span> com.nexa.core.designsystem.component

<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.foundation.layout.fillMaxWidth
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.foundation.layout.height
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.foundation.layout.size
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.foundation.shape.RoundedCornerShape
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.material3.Button
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.material3.ButtonDefaults
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.material3.IconButton
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.material3.Text
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.material3.minimumInteractiveComponentSize
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.runtime.Composable
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.ui.Modifier
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.ui.hapticfeedback.HapticFeedbackType
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.ui.platform.LocalHapticFeedback
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.ui.unit.dp
<span class="kw">import</span> com.nexa.core.designsystem.theme.NexaPrimary
<span class="kw">import</span> com.nexa.core.designsystem.theme.NexaSecondary
<span class="kw">import</span> com.nexa.core.designsystem.theme.NexaTypography

<span class="comm">// 1. Botón Industrial de 56dp para Choferes y Bodega</span>
<span class="ann">@Composable</span>
<span class="kw">fun</span> <span class="fn">NexaIndustrialButton</span>(
    text: <span class="type">String</span>,
    onClick: () -> <span class="type">Unit</span>,
    modifier: <span class="type">Modifier</span> = Modifier,
    enabled: <span class="type">Boolean</span> = <span class="kw">true</span>
) {
    <span class="kw">val</span> haptic = <span class="fn">LocalHapticFeedback</span>.current

    <span class="fn">Button</span>(
        onClick = {
            haptic.<span class="fn">performHapticFeedback</span>(HapticFeedbackType.LongPress)
            onClick()
        },
        modifier = modifier
            .fillMaxWidth()
            .height(<span class="num">56.dp</span>),     <span class="comm">// Altura industrial para guantes de seguridad</span>
        enabled = enabled,
        shape = <span class="fn">RoundedCornerShape</span>(<span class="num">12.dp</span>),
        colors = ButtonDefaults.buttonColors(
            containerColor = NexaSecondary, <span class="comm">// Brand Navy</span>
            contentColor = androidx.compose.ui.graphics.Color.White
        )
    ) {
        <span class="fn">Text</span>(text = text.uppercase(), style = NexaTypography.labelLarge)
    }
}

<span class="comm">// 2. Icono con Bounding Box accesible de 48dp</span>
<span class="ann">@Composable</span>
<span class="kw">fun</span> <span class="fn">NexaAccessibleIconButton</span>(
    onClick: () -> <span class="type">Unit</span>,
    contentDescription: <span class="type">String</span>,
    modifier: <span class="type">Modifier</span> = Modifier,
    content: <span class="ann">@Composable</span> () -> <span class="type">Unit</span>
) {
    <span class="fn">IconButton</span>(
        onClick = onClick,
        modifier = modifier
            .minimumInteractiveComponentSize() <span class="comm">// Garantiza 48x48dp mínimo</span>
            .size(<span class="num">48.dp</span>)
    ) {
        content()
    }
}</code></pre>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<style>
  .ergonomia-48dp-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .target-comparison-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .target-comparison-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .target-spec-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--nexa-color-border-default, #e2e8f0);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px;
    background: #f8fafc;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .target-visual-box {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 24px 16px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .target-bounding-box {
    position: relative;
    border: 2px dashed #3b82f6;
    padding: 8px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.04);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 320px;

    &.ind-56 {
      border-color: #f59e0b;
      background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.05);
    }
  }

  .bounding-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #1d4ed8;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;

    &.industrial {
      color: #b45309;
    }
  }

  .spec-btn-demo {
    width: 100%;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 10px;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-weight: 700;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;

    &.min-48 {
      height: 48px;
      font-size: 14px;
      background: #2a67d9;
    }

    &.max-56 {
      height: 56px;
      font-size: 14.5px;
      background: #082846;
      border: 1px solid #38c8ff;
    }
  }

  .target-spec-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3px;

    strong {
      font-size: 13.5px;
      color: #0f172a;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #64748b;
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
  }
</style>
